<title>ICELAND: Iceland's Keflavik airport Aug activity increases.</title>
<headline>Iceland's Keflavik airport Aug activity increases.</headline>
<dateline>REYKJAVIK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iceland's civil aviation administration issued on Wednesday the following figures for irport activity at Reykjavik's international airport at Keflavik.</p>
<p> KEFLAVIK INT'L AIRPORT	   Aug 1996	    Aug 1995</p>
<p> Freight export (in tonnes)	  671		   613</p>
<p>	   import			  601		   497</p>
<p>	   total			 1,272		 1,110</p>
<p> Mail export (in tonnes)		37		    38</p>
<p>	import (in tonnes)	     118		   118</p>
<p>	total				155		   156</p>
<p> Passengers			  140,800	     129,708</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
